# ---------- Known failures — 3 entries — tracked, NOT aggregated
  - id: adv-known-001
    category: known_failure
    subcategory: rue-de-la-gare-brussels
    query: "Rue de la Gare"
    expected_behavior: |
      Returns zero Brussels matches in top-100; file 13 §1. Top results are Wallonia (Villers-la-Ville, La Roche-en-Ardenne, La Louvière). Tracked for Phase 7 autocomplete design.
    expected_to_fail: true
    introduced: "2026-05-21"
    reference: "airmail-analysis/13-phase6-3-1-design.md \u00a71"
    acceptable_until: "2026-08-21"
  - id: adv-known-002
    category: known_failure
    subcategory: place-de-l-eglise-ambiguous
    query: "Place de l'\u00c9glise"
    expected_behavior: |
      36+ munis have a Place de l'Église. No notability prior should pick a 'right' answer until §3.1 adds whitelist scoring or postal context. Tracked as a Class-2 ambiguous query per file 13 §1.
    expected_to_fail: true
    introduced: "2026-05-21"
    reference: "airmail-analysis/13-phase6-3-1-design.md \u00a71"
    acceptable_until: "2026-08-21"
  - id: adv-known-003
    category: known_failure
    subcategory: anvers-grand-place-cross-region
    query: "Anvers Grand Place"
    expected_behavior: |
      Anvers has no FR street 'Grand Place'. Expected behavior is fuzzy fallback within the Antwerpen/Anvers region, but currently the fuzzy OR returns brussels+wallonia noise. Cross-region leakage on an underspecified query. Tracked as Phase 6.5b region_leakage_rate input.
    expected_to_fail: true
    introduced: "2026-05-21"
    reference: "airmail-analysis/12-phase5-outcomes.md \u00a73.2"
    acceptable_until: "2026-08-21"
